# The running forms. route scopes the weight column to 3 1 8 4 9, whose prefix means are
# integral on purpose: the harness compares within 1e-9, so the mean prefixes are pinned as
# exact integers. gone is the all-false control for the empty scan and the zero count.
n 8
col route bool 1 0 1 1 0 1 0 1
col weight num 3 9 1 8 8 4 7 9
col mixed bool 1 0 1 1 0 0 1 0
col gone bool 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
ja 経路 route
ja 重量 weight
ja 混在 mixed
ja 不在 gone
